          "value": "<h1>Data Retention Policy</h1><p>Records must be retained for <strong>seven years</strong>.</p><p>Applies to the following record types:</p><ul><li>Financial statements</li><li>Contracts &amp; agreements</li><li>Audit logs</li></ul><p>See also <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Security Standards\" /></ac:link> for controls.</p>"
        }
