          "value": "<h2>Security Standards</h2><p>All systems must comply with the following:</p><ol><li>Encrypt data at rest</li><li>Enforce MFA</li><li>Rotate keys quarterly</li></ol><p>Derived from <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Data Retention Policy\" /></ac:link>.</p>"
